-- test-removal-lost/divergence --
suite: test-examples
case: probe/temp-not-removable
go: Go's tack test joins the error of a temporary directory it cannot
  remove to the run's, and its reportTest, finding the tests' failure
  in the join, writes that alone and drops the removal's error.
why: The port writes the tests' failure and then tack: failed to delete
  temp directory: and the error, exit status 1, decided by the language
  owner 2026-11-18 for tack test, extending the ruling for builds.
same: exit, stdout
